{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05183","headline":"送王汶宰江阴 · 张循之","name":"送王汶宰江阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡北乘流去，花间竟日行。\n海鱼朝满市，江鸟夜喧城。\n让酒非关病，援琴不在声。\n应缘五斗米，数日滞渊明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张循之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}